<h1>Debugging</h1>
<p>Pick the service or component that’s giving you trouble. Its guide should get you to the useful checks, recovery procedure and previous incidents.</p>
<p>Use an explicit Kubernetes context. Start with status, events and logs; don’t restart or delete things just to see what happens.</p>

